{"id":"desde","lemma":"desde","pos":"prep","rank":125,"glosses":["since (from a specified time in the past)","from (a location)","starting at (a quantity, such as a price)"],"ipa":"/ˈdesde/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-desde.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mira desde más cerca.","en":"Look closer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439114"},{"text":"Tom trabaja desde casa.","en":"Tom works at home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/108341"},{"text":"Lo hice desde cero.","en":"I made it from scratch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460630"},{"text":"Comencemos desde la lección 3.","en":"Let's begin with Lesson 3.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526925"},{"text":"Desde luego, te recuerdo.","en":"Of course, I remember you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803757"}]}